{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03103","headline":"故徐州刺史赠吏部侍郎苏公挽歌词三首 一 · 张九龄","name":"故徐州刺史赠吏部侍郎苏公挽歌词三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韦玄方继相，荀爽复齐名。\n在贵兼天爵，能贤出世卿。\n学闻金马诏，神见玉人清。\n藏壑今如此，爲山遂不成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}